// wskill standard library — public entry point.
//
// A wskill's root document opts into the format with a single
// `import <wskill.wcl>` line. This file pulls in the prelude, which in turn
// imports every schema part. The parts are embedded in the binary and resolved
// through the registry (see `crates/wcl_wskill/src/stdlib.rs`); the
// angle-bracket path is importer-relative within the `<wcl-system>` namespace,
// so `import <wskill/prelude.wcl>` here resolves to that key.
//
// The PROJECTION templates are parts too, but they are not in this prelude:
// each declares a `site` and its pages, and a document can only be one
// projection at a time. A projection entry imports the one it is —
// `import <wskill/book.wcl>` — or enumerates the parts it wants when it
// overrides one of them (see `wskill/book.wcl`'s header).

namespace wcl.wskill

import <wskill/prelude.wcl>
